<h4 class="jupiter22-c-heading jupiter22-c-heading--inverted jupiter22-c-nasdaq-promo__eyebrow">Cutting Through Complexity in the Financial System</h4>


    
    


<h2 class="jupiter22-c-heading jupiter22-c-heading--inverted jupiter22-c-nasdaq-promo__title">The New Growth Imperative</h2>


          
  <p>We measure the cost of complexity across the financial system and provide new and fresh perspectives on how institutions can adapt to the exponential growth of complexity while minimizing internal complicatedness and friction.</p>

              


  
